    "title": "YourTal contracts",
    "version": "0.0.0",
    "description": "Generated from the Zod schemas in @yourtal/contracts (YT-0031). Do not edit by hand.\n\nThis document carries SCHEMAS ONLY. `paths` is empty because no API surface exists yet — endpoints arrive with apps/api (YT-0100 onward), and each will be added here as it is built.\n\nCross-field rules are documented per component but NOT enforced by this document. Anything that must enforce them has to run the Zod schema or re-implement and test the rule."
